  "fullName": "HHS 405(d) Health Industry Cybersecurity Practices (2023 edition)",
  "description": "The 405(d) program's ten practices for the five biggest healthcare threats (social engineering, ransomware, loss of equipment or data, insider data loss, attacks on connected medical devices).",
  "version": "2026.11.1",
  "researchedAt": "2026-11-20",
